            "review_title": "Review at Phyto Bistro",
            "review_text": "Natalia A\n4 contributions\n1\nMust try\nDec 2023 • Couples\nSuch a rare gem! Phyto bistro is a great place for vegan food. There are not so many options like that in Nha Trang, and definitely not so nice. The place is so cozy, food delicious and kale colada smoothie is a must try! So refreshing. The owner (and chef) is super hospitable and great person to talk to. I will definitely be back and continue trying everything from the menu\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 2, 2023",
